WEBVTT

00:08:59.917 --> 00:09:02.893
So that's it, level two complete.

00:09:02.917 --> 00:09:04.976
But it comes with a warning:

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:09.809
simply reversing the flow
of injustice is not justice.

00:09:09.833 --> 00:09:11.976
That is vengeance,
that is not our mission,

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:16.393
that's a different game
so we level up to level three,

00:09:16.417 --> 00:09:19.476
where the objective
is to change the action,

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:23.018
also known as "calling the police
is not your only option

00:09:23.042 --> 00:09:24.768
OMG, what is wrong with you people!"

00:09:24.792 --> 00:09:26.226
(Applause)

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:30.518
And I need to pause the game
to remind us of the structure.